    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "כי יהיה",
      "rationale": "Ladjɛbili fila-fila-sanu 'ki a kɛra' bɛ tugu u nɔɔ na, dɔɔni-dɔɔni; a lajɛbali cogoya nɔgɔyara Bamanankan na."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "שדפון \/ ירקון",
      "rationale": "Bamaya-fɛnw tɔgɔw tilennenw (blight, mildew); Bamanankan tɛ o tɔgɔ tilannen dɔw ye — an dilannenw b'a lajɛ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "alternative",
      "subject": "בארץ שעריו",
      "rationale": "Kɔrɔ tiɲɛna: 'dugukolo la min kɔnɔ a ka dɔw bɛ yen' — a tɛ 'a ka duguw' dɔrɔn de ye; n'an y'o jɔ yɔrɔ wɛrɛ la a bɛna 'a ka dugu damɛw la' kɛ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Kɔngɔbana, ni a kɛra dugukolo na; bana gɛlɛn, ni a kɛra; forofagabana ani bulukubana; laku ani sunsunu, ni u kɛra; ni a ka jugutɔw ka a datugu a ye, dugukolo la, a ka dɔw la — dɛsɛ bɛɛ ani bana bɛɛ min bɛ se ka kɛ:",
